---
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 20
    width: 110
    messageMargin: 30
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Test as Your test
  participant Agent as Your agent
  participant AR as agent-retrace
  participant File as Recording file

  Test->>AR: replay(name, fn)
  AR->>File: load steps 1 to 3
  AR->>Agent: run fn()
  Agent->>AR: LLM request
  Note over AR: matches step 1
  AR-->>Agent: recorded "call lookup_order"
  Agent->>AR: lookup_order call
  Note over AR: matches step 2, tool does not run
  AR-->>Agent: recorded result
  Agent->>AR: LLM request
  Note over AR: matches step 3
  AR-->>Agent: recorded final answer
  Agent-->>AR: fn returns
  Note over AR: every step used?<br/>yes: pass, no: ChangeDetectedError
  AR-->>Test: replay() returns
